/**
 * 02-create-agent-with-tools.ts -- Agent with marketplace plugin tool
 *
 * Creates an agent with full configuration, searches the marketplace for a
 * tool (e.g., Gmail), retrieves tool detail with actions and parameter schemas,
 * checks for existing credentials, creates a PLUGIN tool config on the agent,
 * and verifies the setup.
 *
